      "original_event_citation_accuracy": "Correctly cited required support records plus correct additional citations divided by all required support records plus all additional citations in the frozen selected workload. Missing required citations receive zero. Wrong additional citations remain in the denominator; extra correct citations cannot replace missing required sources. Invented citations separately violate the zero-fabrication boundary.",
      "personal_proposition_grounding": "Grounded personal propositions divided by all personal propositions actually asserted. An empty proposition set is not a perfect grounding score and does not improve the aggregate.",
      "reader_latency_quantile": "All 24 attempted cases per condition and repetition, nearest rank; retain timeouts and failures with their bound and status. No successful-only quantile can establish a passing gate.",
      "supported_answer_component_recall": "Semantically supported expected personal answer components divided by all declared expected personal components for answerable cases in the frozen selected workload. Missing, contradicted and unsupported components receive zero; honest abstention cannot remove a component from the denominator.",
      "unwanted_evidence_fraction": "Distinct delivered source records outside gold support and acceptable contextual records divided by all distinct delivered source records, pooled across all 24 cases. Deduplicate overlap and Claim/excerpt copies of one original source."
